Hey there 

It's Maddie here from Originality.AI! 

I wanted to reach out to help you get the most out of our tool and to
help you get familiar with our core features and functionality. 

Today, I want to talk to you about our World Class

**AI detector and the Chrome Extension**. 

**AI Detection and Chrome Extension  **

Our AI Detector is by far the most accurate AI detector in the WORLD at
a 99% accuracy rate for GPT-4.

We outperform all other alternative detection tools on the latest and
most challenging NLP models (ChatGPT, GPT-4). 

While anyone can use this tool, it is going to be especially useful for
Publishers, Content Agencies and Writers. 

Although Originality.AI has the most accurate AI detection score we
don't believe that you should apply hard rules around your AI
detection processes and scores. False positives (although low) will
never get to ZERO, and you should approach your response to AI detection
with this in mind. 

For example, if you have a writer that submits content that scores well
for originality 9/10 times, and then gets flagged for AI generated
content once, then this should be treated as a false positive.

By contrast, if a writer submits content that continuously gets flagged
as AI generated, then it probably is. 

**We Want to Support Writers! **

We owned and operated a Content Agency for many years until we sold last
year. We have worked as content marketers and alongside content creators
for most of our careers! 

We understand first hand

**how much it sucks** and how painful it is to be accused of cheating
when you actually didn't! 

We also understand why accurate AI detection is the 

**KEY**to maintaining high industry standards that are able to
differentiate between the works of Humans and Artificial Intelligence.

Without AI detection tools, legitimate writers are going to compete with
anybody and everybody!

To eliminate some ambiguity in the case of a false positive we created a
FREE Chrome Extension
<https://jonhaver.lt.acemlnb.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZvcmlnaW5hbGl0eS5haSUyRmZyZWUtYWktY29udGVudC1kZXRlY3Rvci1jaHJvbWUtZXh0ZW5zaW9u&sig=Gpuu6Ao1rBH52Ft8v6VasvhPjf6NvN3BJFFFQ4RFbGPt&iat=1688763907&a=%7C%7C798597961%7C%7C&account=jonhaver%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=dJGYAiHNOo7dKl7gTDpTs6diqmdwesqOCikMwkfM7iOwF0jSjrRoSvTyAJk%3D%3A%2BnpbGVbj4h8MnCNcW2vt7T78cf03UJFn&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1891A2055A61A29225>specific
to writers to help them prove that their content is original. 

This Chrome Extension is not spyware, it simply allows the publisher to
visualize the creation process of a Google document and understand who
contributed and how long it took to create this document. These reports
make it pretty clear if someone has written their own content. 

If you're going to be using Originality.AI, we really encourage you to
use this feature. It will help everyone with a balanced need for
transparency given the new realities we're facing with AI. 

